{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p002767","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p002767"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p002767","label":"公孫閲（田世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"公孫閲","mention_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0012","c-shiji-046-tian:m034-0005"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p032","quote":"公孫閲"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m034-0005","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p034","quote":"公孫閲"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m032-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"公孫閲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002767","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p032","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m034-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"公孫閲","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002767","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p034","chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji046-061","person_id":"cbr-p002767","scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-046-tian"],"status":"contextual_provisional","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","surfaces":["公孫閲"],"evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p032","quote":"其後成侯騶忌與田忌不善，公孫閲謂成侯忌曰：「公何不謀伐魏，田忌必將。戰勝有功，則公之謀中也；戰不勝，非前死則後北，而命在公矣。」於是成侯言威王，使田忌南攻襄陵。十月，邯鄲拔，齊因起兵撃魏，大敗之桂陵。于是齊最彊于諸侯，自稱爲王，以令天下。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p034","quote":"三十五年，公孫閲又謂成侯忌曰：「公何不令人操十金卜於市，曰『我田忌之人也。吾三戰而三勝，聲威天下。欲爲大事，亦吉乎不吉乎』？」卜者出，因令人捕爲之卜者，驗其辭於王之所。田忌聞之，因率其徒襲攻臨淄，求成侯，不勝而奔。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、是為、繼位及局部事件暫接；姜齊與田齊桓公、不同時段未名王及同字忌分開。孫子不先補孫臏，子守髙唐不補闕字，索隱短稱與代詞仍待核；未跨篇按同名接人。"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p032","text":"其後成侯騶忌與田忌不善，公孫閲謂成侯忌曰：「公何不謀伐魏，田忌必將。戰勝有功，則公之謀中也；戰不勝，非前死則後北，而命在公矣。」於是成侯言威王，使田忌南攻襄陵。十月，邯鄲